{"id":"666231","name":"蒸面条菜","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/666231/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面条菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"普通面粉","amount":"少许"}],"sub":[{"name":"水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"新鲜的面条菜。","img":"images/666231/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"面条菜摘净。","img":"images/666231/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"清洗干净，控干净水。","img":"images/666231/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入盆中。","img":"images/666231/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"先用少量油。","img":"images/666231/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"抓拌均匀，如图所示。","img":"images/666231/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加2勺盐入个底味。","img":"images/666231/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"抓拌均匀，如图所示。","img":"images/666231/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"少量多次的加入面粉。","img":"images/666231/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"每个叶片都粘上面粉。","img":"images/666231/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/666231/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"反复几次加入面粉。","img":"images/666231/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"拌匀，止到这样松散的状态，每个叶片都粘上面粉，如图所示。","img":"images/666231/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"水开上汽上锅蒸3分钟。","img":"images/666231/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"蒸好了。","img":"images/666231/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"倒盆里。","img":"images/666231/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"用筷子快速抖散晾凉。","img":"images/666231/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"晾凉后加入蒜泥和香油拌匀。","img":"images/666231/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"美味可口。","img":"images/666231/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}